</head><body>

<p>Dear $USER.firstName $USER.lastName,</p><br />

<p>Please be advised that $APPROVER.firstName $APPROVER.lastName has declined your Expense Claims on $DECLINE_DATE.
You can review $APPROVER.firstName $APPROVER.lastName 's comments, and make the appropriate changes and resubmit the report.</p>

<p>Click <a href="$HOST/Accounting.html?link=$LINK&uid=$uid&cid=$companyid" title="Edit Expense Claims" target="_blank">here </a>
to view and edit the Expense Claims.</p>

#if($rejectNote != '')
<p>$rejectNote</p>
#end

<p><font color='red'>* </font>If you are not able to click on the link, you can copy and paste the following address into your web browser:<br />
$HOST/Accounting.html?link=$LINK&uid=$uid&cid=$companyid</p>

<p></p>

</body></html>